  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">El Teatro M&oacute;naco ha acogido la ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo el sorteo de &#39;cadafals&#39; para la Fira d&#39;Onda 2014, presidido por la que ser&aacute; la reina desde el pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado 11 de octubre, Ana Gargallo Porcar, y sus damas, Luc&iacute;a Aibar Sol y Eva Navarro Mora.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/SorteigCadafalsFira2014-planol.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 363px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Tambi&eacute;n estaba presente el concejal de Fiestas y presidente del Consell de Festes, Leonardo Molina Corella. La futura reina ha ido extrayendo las bolas de la bolsa con el n&uacute;mero correspondiente, que Salvador Ramos Serrano, componente del Consell, iba anotando en&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong><a href=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/SorteigCadafalsFira2014-planol.jpg\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: Arial; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\" target=\"_blank\">un gran plano con los &#39;cadafals&#39; de todo el recorrido</a></strong></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5148.jpg\" alt=\"img_5148\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5150.jpg\" alt=\"img_5150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5152.jpg\" alt=\"img_5152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5153.jpg\" alt=\"img_5153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5155.jpg\" alt=\"img_5155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5156.jpg\" alt=\"img_5156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5157.jpg\" alt=\"img_5157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5158.jpg\" alt=\"img_5158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5159.jpg\" alt=\"img_5159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5160.jpg\" alt=\"img_5160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5161.jpg\" alt=\"img_5161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5162.jpg\" alt=\"img_5162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5163.jpg\" alt=\"img_5163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5164.jpg\" alt=\"img_5164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals14/img_5165.jpg\" alt=\"img_5165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f2